    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottom Dwellers is a cozy little aquarium that sits at the bottom of your screen. Collect and grow different fishes, discover shrimps and decorate your tank while you work or play on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/f0e7b960157e6c781816b14f0a37e3bf.avif?t=1749252199\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/b8eef6fac2149ecc1cc19901e1111236.avif?t=1749252199\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrimps are friends, not food! Unlock these shrimps and put them to work. Collect coins, feed fish, <span class=\"bb_strike\">file your taxes</span> and hold a concert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/43c477a6d4af1752984fdb446541ed84.avif?t=1749252199\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know what else your fishes need? Plants! And rocks. And more plants. Oh and corals too. Decorations go brr and tank happiness go brr. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/c5556c90b05c1a5ea097913dcd7f5f3b.avif?t=1749252199\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woah wait whats that?? Invasion mode lets you have some unruly &quot;friends&quot; over. You can disable this in the options to have a perfectly peaceful tank. No shark attacks, promise!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottom Dwellers is a cozy little aquarium that sits at the bottom of your screen. Collect and grow different fishes, discover shrimps and decorate your tank while you work or play on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/f0e7b960157e6c781816b14f0a37e3bf.avif?t=1749252199\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/b8eef6fac2149ecc1cc19901e1111236.avif?t=1749252199\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrimps are friends, not food! Unlock these shrimps and put them to work. Collect coins, feed fish, <span class=\"bb_strike\">file your taxes</span> and hold a concert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/43c477a6d4af1752984fdb446541ed84.avif?t=1749252199\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know what else your fishes need? Plants! And rocks. And more plants. Oh and corals too. Decorations go brr and tank happiness go brr. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/c5556c90b05c1a5ea097913dcd7f5f3b.avif?t=1749252199\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woah wait whats that?? Invasion mode lets you have some unruly &quot;friends&quot; over. You can disable this in the options to have a perfectly peaceful tank. No shark attacks, promise!</p>",
